  "memo": "Recommend clear under FP-2 §6.6(c). R04 holds because this is a first attempt on a newly opened account with an amount above the category's approved-order percentile threshold. It is Context only. R01, R11, R03, R07, R05, R02, R08, R06(a), R06(b), R09 and R10 do not hold; no adverse family is present, and household exceptions are unnecessary. No earlier outcome settles the order, and no check has completed. A legitimate new customer making a substantial promotional purchase is more plausible than synthetic identity on the available evidence. No installment was due, so non-payment cannot support action. Context-only concerns do not permit verification friction; no next check is warranted."
